# text = I , being the younger by five or six years , was always regarded as THE child , and the pet of the family : father , mother , and sister , all combined to spoil me -- not by foolish indulgence , to render me fractious and ungovernable , but by ceaseless kindness , to make me too helpless and dependent -- too unfit for buffeting with the cares and turmoils of life .
