# text = For the present , it is true , we were reduced to the narrow income of the curacy ; but my father seemed to think there was no necessity for scrupulously restricting our expenditure to that ; so , with a standing bill at Mr . Jackson's , another at Smith's , and a third at Hobson's , we got along even more comfortably than before : though my mother affirmed we had better keep within bounds , for our prospects of wealth were but precarious , after all ; and if my father would only trust everything to her management , he should never feel himself stinted : but he , for once , was incorrigible .
