# text = Yet , after all , when we entered the lofty iron gateway , when we drove softly up the smooth , well-rolled carriage-road , with the green lawn on each side , studded with young trees , and approached the new but stately mansion of Wellwood , rising above its mushroom poplar-groves , my heart failed me , and I wished it were a mile or two farther off .
