# text = I would gladly have eaten the potatoes and let the meat alone , but having got a large piece of the latter on to my plate , I could not be so impolite as to leave it ; so , after many awkward and unsuccessful attempts to cut it with the knife , or tear it with the fork , or pull it asunder between them , sensible that the awful lady was a spectator to the whole transaction , I at last desperately grasped the knife and fork in my fists , like a child of two years old , and fell to work with all the little strength I possessed .
