# text = When the ceremony was concluded , she led me into the sitting-room again , where she rang and sent for the children said she , ' for I have had so little time to attend to their education myself , and we have thought them too young for a governess till now ; but I think they are clever children , and very apt to learn , especially the little boy ; he is , I think , the flower of the flock -- a generous , noble-spirited boy , one to be led , but not driven , and remarkable for always speaking the truth .
