# text = I tried to amuse the little fellow , and listened to all his chatter as complacently as I could ; for I thought if he had any affections at all , I would endeavour to win them ; and then , in time , I might be able to show him the error of his ways : but I looked in vain for that generous , noble spirit his mother talked of ; though I could see he was not without a certain degree of quickness and penetration , when he chose to exert it .
