# text = Yet Tom was by no means the most unmanageable of my pupils : sometimes , to my great joy , he would have the sense to see that his wisest policy was to finish his tasks , and go out and amuse himself till I and his sisters came to join him ; which frequently was not at all , for Mary Ann seldom followed his example in this particular : she apparently preferred rolling on the floor to any other amusement : down she would drop like a leaden weight ; and when I , with great difficulty , had succeeded in rooting her thence , I had still to hold her up with one arm , while with the other I held the book from which she was to read or spell her lesson .
