# text = If I had passed it over as a matter of no consequence , it would have been better for both parties , than vainly striving to overcome it as I did ; but I thought it my absolute duty to crush this vicious tendency in the bud : and so it was , if I could have done it ; and had my powers been less limited , I might have enforced obedience ; but , as it was , it was a trial of strength between her and me , in which she generally came off victorious ; and every victory served to encourage and strengthen her for a future contest .
