# text = To avoid trouble and confusion , I have taken my pupils one by one , and discussed their various qualities ; but this can give no adequate idea of being worried by the whole three together ; when , as was often the case , all were determined to Sometimes , on such occasions , the thought has suddenly occurred to me meaning , of course , my friends at home ; and the idea of how they would pity me has made me pity myself -- so greatly that I have had the utmost difficulty to restrain my tears : but I have restrained them , till my little tormentors were gone to dessert , or cleared off to bed ( my only prospects of deliverance ), and then , in all the bliss of solitude , I have given myself up to the luxury of an unrestricted burst of weeping .
