# text = Thus urged , he would frequently give himself the trouble of watching them from the windows during their play ; at times , he would follow them through the grounds , and too often came suddenly upon them while they were dabbling in the forbidden well , talking to the coachman in the stables , or revelling in the filth of the farm-yard -- and I , meanwhile , wearily standing , by , having previously exhausted my energy in vain attempts to get them away .
