# text = The unknown lady , in her reply , made no objection to this , and stated that , as to my acquirements , she had no doubt I should be able to give satisfaction ; but in the engagement of governesses she considered those things as but subordinate points ; as being situated in the neighbourhood of O ---, she could get masters to supply any deficiencies in that respect : but , in her opinion , next to unimpeachable morality , a mild and cheerful temper and obliging disposition were the most essential requisities .
