# text = My mother did not relish this at all , and now made many objections to my accepting the situation ; in which my sister warmly supported her : but , unwilling to be balked again , I overruled them all ; and , having first obtained the consent of my father ( who had , a short time previously , been apprised of these transactions ), I wrote a most obliging epistle to my unknown correspondent , and , finally , the bargain was concluded .
