# text = It was decreed that on the last day of January I was to enter upon my new office as governess in the family of Mr . Murray , of Horton Lodge , near O ---, about seventy miles from our village : a formidable distance to me , as I had never been above twenty miles from home in all the course of my twenty years' sojourn on earth ; and as , moreover , every individual in that family and in the neighbourhood was utterly unknown to myself and all my acquaintances .
