# text = Then , my pupils being older , would be more rational , more teachable , and less troublesome than the last ; they would be less confined to the schoolroom , and not require that constant labour and incessant watching ; and , finally , bright visions mingled with my hopes , with which the care of children and the mere duties of a governess had little or nothing to do .
