# text = Thus , the reader will see that I had no claim to be regarded as a martyr to filial piety , going forth to sacrifice peace and liberty for the sole purpose of laying up stores for the comfort and support of my parents : though certainly the comfort of my father , and the future support of my mother , had a large share in my calculations ; and fifty pounds appeared to me no ordinary sum .
