# text = I must have decent clothes becoming my station ; I must , it seemed , put out my washing , and also pay for my four annual journeys between Horton Lodge and home ; but with strict attention to economy , surely twenty pounds , or little more , would cover those expenses , and then there would be thirty for the bank , or little less : what a valuable addition to our stock !
