# text = But this gives no proper idea of my feelings at all ; and no one that has not lived such a retired , stationary life as mine , can possibly imagine what they were : hardly even if he has known what it is to awake some morning , and find himself in Port Nelson , in New Zealand , with a world of waters between himself and all that knew him .
