# text = I did not see her till eleven o'clock on the morning after my arrival ; when she honoured me with a visit , just as my mother might step into the kitchen to see a new servant-girl : yet not so , either , for my mother would have seen her immediately after her arrival , and not waited till the next day ; and , moreover , she would have addressed her in a more kind and friendly manner , and given her some words of comfort as well as a plain exposition of her duties ; but Mrs .
