# text = Towards me , when I first came , she was cold and haughty , then insolent and overbearing ; but , on a further acquaintance , she gradually laid aside her airs , and in time became as deeply attached to me as it was possible for HER to be to one of my character and position : for she seldom lost sight , for above half an hour at a time , of the fact of my being a hireling and a poor curate's daughter .
