# text = Short and easy as her tasks were , if done at all , they were slurred over , at any time and in any way ; but generally at the least convenient times , and in the way least beneficial to herself , and least satisfactory to me : the short half-hour of practising was horribly strummed through ; she , meantime , unsparingly abusing me , either for interrupting her with corrections , or for not rectifying her mistakes before they were made , or something equally unreasonable .
