# text = At ten years old , he could not read correctly the easiest line in the simplest book ; and as , according to his mother's principle , he was to be told every word , before he had time to hesitate or examine its orthography , and never even to be informed , as a stimulant to exertion , that other boys were more forward than he , it is not surprising that he made but little progress during the two years I had charge of his education .
