# text = His minute portions of Latin grammar , & amp ; c ., were to be repeated over to him , till he chose to say he knew them , and then he was to be helped to say them ; if he made mistakes in his little easy sums in arithmetic , they were to be shown him at once , and the sum done for him , instead of his being left to exercise his faculties in finding them out himself ; so that , of course , he took no pains to avoid mistakes , but frequently set down his figures at random , without any calculation at all .
