# text = While receiving my instructions , or repeating what they had learned , they would lounge upon the sofa , lie on the rug , stretch , yawn , talk to each other , or look out of the window ; whereas , I could not so much as stir the fire , or pick up the handkerchief I had dropped , without being rebuked for inattention by one of my pupils , or told that The servants , seeing in what little estimation the governess was held by both parents and children , regulated their behaviour by the same standard .
