# text = But such illusions were usually dissipated , on coming out of church , by hearing his voice in jocund colloquy with some of the Melthams or Greens , or , perhaps , the Murrays themselves ; probably laughing at his own sermon , and hoping that he had given the rascally people something to think about ; perchance , exulting in the thought that old Betty Holmes would now lay aside the sinful indulgence of her pipe , which had been her daily solace for upwards of thirty years : that George Higgins would be frightened out of his Sabbath evening walks , and Thomas Jackson would be sorely troubled in his conscience , and shaken in his sure and certain hope of a joyful resurrection at the last day .
