# text = My companions , however , had been more observant ; and , as we rolled along , they discussed between them not only his looks , words , and actions , but every feature of his face , and every article of his apparel said Miss Matilda at the close of this discussion replied her sister , in a tone of affected indifference continued the other Matilda was beginning an angry reply ; but , happily , our journey was now at an end ; and the contention was cut short by the footman opening the carriage-door , and letting down the steps for our descent
