# text = I made many and various attempts to deliver my pupils from these delusive notions without alarming their pride -- which was easily offended , and not soon appeased -- but with little apparent result ; and I know not which was the more reprehensible of the two : Matilda was more rude and boisterous ; but from Rosalie's womanly age and lady-like exterior better things were expected : yet she was as provokingly careless and inconsiderate as a giddy child of twelve .
