# text = Whatever occupation I chose , when not actually busied about them or their concerns , I had , as it were , to keep my loins girded , my shoes on my feet , and my staff in my hand ; for not to be immediately forthcoming when called for , was regarded as a grave and inexcusable offence : not only by my pupils and their mother , but by the very servant , who came in breathless haste to call me , exclaiming Climax of horror ! actually waiting for their governess !!!
