# text = He listened with a quiet , good - natured smile , and at length took a seat in compliance with her pressing invitations , but repeated that he did not mean to stay said he cried the provoking old woman , and Mr . Weston seized his hat exclaimed she replied I , hoping there was no harm in a falsehood of that description cried Nancy said he , half-jestingly , as if he felt it necessary to change the present subject , whether he had anything particular to say or not replied he , in dolorous resignation : then , with a peculiar half-smile , he added and left the cottage .
