# text = But she soon betook herself to the stables , and left me to the quiet enjoyment of my solitary meal Miss Murray now always went twice to church , for she so loved admiration that she could not bear to lose a single opportunity of obtaining it ; and she was so sure of it wherever she showed herself , that , whether Harry Meltham and Mr . Green were there or not , there was certain to be somebody present who would not be insensible to her charms , besides the Rector , whose official capacity generally obliged him to attend .
