# text = Thus -- I am almost ashamed to confess it -- but indeed I gave myself no little trouble in my endeavours ( if I did keep up with them ) to appear perfectly unconscious or regardless of their presence , as if I were wholly absorbed in my own reflections , or the contemplation of surrounding objects ; or , if I lingered behind , it was some bird or insect , some tree or flower , that attracted my attention , and having duly examined that , I would pursue my walk alone , at a leisurely pace , until my pupils had bidden adieu to their companions and turned off into the quiet private road .
