# text = On the afternoon of the fourth , as we were walking beside the park-palings in the memorable field , each furnished with a book ( for I always took care to provide myself with something to be doing when she did not require me to talk ), she suddenly interrupted my studies by exclaiming said she , throwing me her purse , and speaking very fast I did as I was desired ; but , suspecting something from her hurried manner and the suddenness of the request , I just glanced back before I quitted the field , and there was Mr .
