# text = There are , I suppose , some men as vain , as selfish , and as heartless as she is , and , perhaps , such women may be useful to punish them said Rosalie next day at four P.M ., as , with a portentous yawn , she laid down her worsted-work and looked listlessly towards the window observed Matilda , to whom this lamentation was addressed exclaimed Matilda , somewhat contemptuously Her sister was slightly offended ; but the event proved Matilda was right : the disappointed lover performed his pastoral duties as usual .
