# text = It might be partly owing to my own stupidity , my want of tact and assurance : but I felt myself wronged : I trembled with apprehension ; and I listened with envy to her easy , rapid flow of utterance , and saw with anxiety the bright smile with which she looked into his face from time to time : for she was walking a little in advance , for the purpose ( as I judged ) of being seen as well as heard .
