# text = I must restrain and swallow back my feelings still : there was the bell -- the odious bell for the schoolroom dinner ; and I must go down with a calm face , and smile , and laugh , and talk nonsense -- yes , and eat , too , if possible , as if all was right , and I was just returned from a pleasant walk Next Sunday was one of the gloomiest of April days -- a day of thick , dark clouds , and heavy showers .
