# text = Sometimes , such thoughts would give me trouble enough ; but sometimes I could quiet them with thinking -- it is not the man , it is his goodness that I love We do well to worship God in His works ; and I know none of them in which so many of His attributes -- so much of His own spirit shines , as in this His faithful servant ; whom to know and not to appreciate , were obtuse insensibility in me , who have so little else to occupy my heart .
