# text = He endeavoured to supply the want of his presence by a pretty constant fire of billets-doux ; but these did not attract the neighbours' attention , and open their eyes , as personal visits would have done ; and old Lady Ashby's haughty , sour spirit of reserve withheld her from spreading the news , while her indifferent health prevented her coming to visit her future daughter-in-law ; so that , altogether , this affair was kept far closer than such things usually are .
