# text = Hereby , she earned among them the reputation of a condescending and very charitable young lady ; and their encomiums were sure to be repeated to Mr . Weston : whom also she had thus a daily chance of meeting in one or other of their abodes , or in her transits to and fro ; and often , likewise , she could gather , through their gossip , to what places he was likely to go at such and such a time , whether to baptize a child , or to visit the aged , the sick , the sad , or the dying ; and most skilfully she laid her plans accordingly .
