# text = Matilda was now sadly at a loss for amusement , and wofully in want of a companion : her brothers at school , her sister married and gone , she too young to be admitted into society ; for which , from Rosalie's example , she was in some degree beginning to acquire a taste -- a taste at least for the company of certain classes of gentlemen ; at this dull time of year -- no hunting going on , no shooting even -- for , though she might not join in that , it was SOMETHING to see her father or the gamekeeper go out with the dogs , and to talk with them on their return , about the different birds they had bagged .
