# text = I did so to the best of my power : but she would not be amused against her will , and could not against her taste ; and though I went beyond mere reminding , such gentle remonstrances as I could use were utterly ineffectual I replied I was about to give the lady some idea of the fallacy of her expectations ; but she sailed away as soon as she had concluded her speech .
