# text = Of course , we both applauded our mother's resolution ; Mary cleared away the breakfast things ; I brought the desk ; the letter was quickly written and despatched ; and , from that day , we heard no more of our grandfather , till we saw his death announced in the newspaper a considerable time after -- all his worldly possessions , of course , being left to our wealthy unknown cousins A house in A ---, the fashionable watering-place , was hired for our seminary ; and a promise of two or three pupils was obtained to commence with .
