# text = But still , I would think of him : I would cherish his image in my mind ; and treasure every word , look , and gesture that my memory could retain ; and brood over his excellences and his peculiarities , and , in fact , all I had seen , heard , or imagined respecting him So said my mother , as we sat at work one morning during the Easter holidays .
