# text = I knew my strength was declining , my appetite had failed , and I was grown listless and desponding ;-- and if , indeed , he could never care for me , and I could never see him more -- if I was forbidden to minister to his happiness -- forbidden , for ever , to taste the joys of love , to bless , and to be blessed -- then , life must be a burden , and if my heavenly Father would call me away , I should be glad to rest .
