# text = The mansion was stately without , commodious and elegant within ; the park was spacious and beautiful , chiefly on account of its magnificent old trees , its stately herds of deer , its broad sheet of water , and the ancient woods that stretched beyond it : for there was no broken ground to give variety to the landscape , and but very little of that undulating swell which adds so greatly to the charm of park scenery .
