# text = I was not ashamed of it at all ; for , though plain , I had taken good care not to shabby or mean , and should have been pretty considerably at my ease , if my condescending hostess had not taken such manifest pains to make me so ; and , as for the magnificence that surrounded her , nothing that met my eyes struck me or affected me half so much as her own altered appearance .
