# text = As I was not rich enough to possess a watch , I could not tell how time was passing , except by observing the slowly lengthening shadows from the window ; which presented a side view , including a corner of the park , a clump of trees whose topmost branches had been colonized by an innumerable company of noisy rooks , and a high wall with a massive wooden gate : no doubt communicating with the stable-yard , as a broad carriage-road swept up to it from the park .
