# text = But however interesting such a scene might be , I could not wait to witness it , for the sun and the sea so dazzled my eyes in that direction , that I could but afford one glance ; and then I turned again to delight myself with the sight and the sound of the sea , dashing against my promontory -- with no prodigious force , for the swell was broken by the tangled sea-weed and the unseen rocks beneath ; otherwise I should soon have been deluged with spray .
