# text = This was a very foolish answer , but the truth was , I considered that I had no right to invite anyone to my mother's house without her knowledge ; and if I had said it would appear as if by his question I understood more than was expected ; so , SUPPOSING she would not , I added but of course I should have said something more sensible and more polite , if I had had my wits about me .
