# text = We continued our walk for a minute in silence ; which , however , was shortly relieved ( no small relief to me ) by Mr . Weston commenting upon the brightness of the morning and the beauty of the bay , and then upon the advantages A --- possessed over many other fashionable places of resort F --- was a village about two miles distant from A said I He looked at me as he concluded : and the flash of his dark eyes seemed to set my face on fire ; greatly to my own discomfiture , for to evince confusion at such a juncture was intolerable .
