# text = I made an effort , therefore , to remedy the evil , and disclaim all personal application of the remark by a hasty , ill-expressed reply , to the effect that , if he waited till he was well known in the neighbourhood , he might have numerous opportunities for supplying his want among the residents of F --- and its vicinity , or the visitors of A ---, if he required so ample a choice : not considering the compliment implied by such an assertion , till his answer made me aware of it said he Here the conversation was interrupted by a water-cart lumbering past us , for we were now come to the busy part of the sands ; and , for the next eight or ten minutes , between carts and horses , and asses , and men , there was little room for social intercourse , till we had turned our backs upon the sea , and begun to ascend the precipitous road leading into the town .
