# text = He stopped there , however , bid me good-morning , and called Snap , who seemed a little doubtful whether to follow his old mistress or his new master , but trotted away upon being summoned by the latter said Mr . Weston , smiling replied I The man and the dog departed , and I returned home , full of gratitude to heaven for so much bliss , and praying that my hopes might not again be crushed said my mother , observing that I drank an extra cup of coffee and ate nothing -- pleading the heat of the weather , and the fatigue of my long walk as an excuse .
