# text = One evening , however , in the last week of the vacation , he arrived - - unexpectedly : for a heavy and protracted thunder-shower during the afternoon had almost destroyed my hopes of seeing him that day ; but now the storm was over , and the sun was shining brightly said he , as he entered I went to get ready , and was down again in a few minutes ; though , of course , I took a little more pains with my attire than if I had merely been going out on some shopping expedition alone .
